<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Mind Reader</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel+Decorative:wght@700,900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600&family=Raleway:wght@400,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/1787/1787077.png">
</head>
<body>
    <div id="particles-js"></div>
    <div id="background-animation" class="bg-animation bg-animation-1"></div>
    
    <div class="header-controls">
        <a href="/" class="logo">
            <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/1787/1787077.png" alt="Mind Reader Brain Logo">
        </a>
        <div class="auth-section">
            <% if (locals.user) { %>
                <span class="welcome-message">Welcome, <%= user.email %>!</span>
                <a href="/logout" class="auth-button">Logout</a>
            <% } else { %>
                <a href="/" class="auth-button">Play Game</a>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-wrapper about-page">
        <h1 class="animated-text">About Mind Reader</h1>
        <div class="about-content">
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>Welcome to Mind Reader, where magic meets mathematics. Our mission is to create a moment of wonder and surprise, reminding everyone of the simple joys of a clever trick. We believe that entertainment can be both fun and intellectually stimulating, and our game is a testament to that philosophy.</p>
            
            <h2>The Secret Behind the Magic</h2>
            <p>Ever wondered how we can read your mind? The secret isn't supernatural—it's a beautiful piece of algebra! The steps we guide you through are carefully designed to always lead to a predictable result based on the even number you add. It's a classic mathematical principle dressed up as a magical experience.</p>
            <p>No matter what number you start with, the sequence of operations cancels it out, leaving only half of the number we asked you to add. It's a perfect illusion that showcases the elegance of numbers.</p>

            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>Have questions, feedback, or need support? We'd love to hear from you. Please don't hesitate to reach out to our dedicated support team.</p>
            <p class="support-email">
                <a href="mailto:support@mindreader.fun">support@mindreader.fun</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- // ... (rest of the file) ... -->

    <!-- Footer (Updated) -->
    <footer class="site-footer">
        <p>&copy; 2025 Mind Reader. All Rights Reserved. | <a href="/about">About</a> | <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a> | For support, contact: <a href="mailto:support@mindreader.fun">support@mindreader.fun</a></p>
    </footer>

<!-- // ... (rest of the file) ... -->



    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/particles.js/2.0.0/particles.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/script.js"></script> <!-- Reusing main script for particles -->
</body>
</html>

